e226586d7a30"],

Cell["\<\
Our backpacks need supplies for the journey: enough food, water, medical \
supplies, ropes and tackle, and so on, to keep us alive and happy while we \
search for the keys to The Wondrous Machine. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9793028957188587`*^9, 3.979302964887743*^9}, {
