Cell[TextData[{
 "Toolkit function ",
 StyleBox["CalculateRicciComponent", "Input"],
 " requires a Riemann-getter function. The Riemann-getter calls toolkit \
function ",
 StyleBox["CalculateRiemannComponent", "Input"],
 ", which requires a \[CapitalGamma]\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]getter function. \
Define that first."
}], "Text",
